Package: ExpectedDegreeDepth
Type: Package
Title: Expected Degree and K-Hull Depth
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person(
      "Erik", "Mendroš",
      email = "erikmendros@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description:
    Computes expected degree depth and k-hull depth of multivariate data.
    Simplicial depth is available as the special case of k-hull depth with
    k equal to d + 1. The implementation supports arbitrary dimensions and
    combines R and C++ code for efficient computation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
